---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About — Ybor" description="Ybor is a platform engineering company building the infrastructure layer for enterprise software. Founded 2024. SOC 2® Type II report." active="company">

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero bg-tint-soft">
  <div class="container center" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-block:88px 56px">
    <div style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="slash">//</span> about</span>
      <h1 class="display-lg balance">Ybor is platform engineering, built by platform engineers.</h1>
      <p class="body-lg muted pretty" style="max-width:680px;margin:22px auto 0">We started Ybor because every enterprise platform team we'd worked on was solving the same problems — and rebuilding the same plumbing every two years. We're building the platform we wished we had.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MISSION -->
<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split split-6-6">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow"><span class="slash">//</span> the mission</span>
        <h2 class="heading-lg balance">Why Ybor exists.</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="body-lg muted pretty" style="margin-bottom:18px">Enterprises don't lack engineers. They lack a platform that lets those engineers ship without negotiating Kubernetes, multi-cloud, and compliance from scratch every time.</p>
        <p class="body-lg muted pretty" style="margin-bottom:18px">We build the layer in between: a layered object model, operators that reconcile it, and an addon catalog that runs on every cluster. You keep your source code, your clusters, and your data.</p>
        <p class="body-lg muted pretty">We're not building another dashboard. We're building the backend a platform team can defend in a board meeting — and extend on their own terms.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- LEADERSHIP -->
<section class="section bg-tint">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head center"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="slash">//</span> leadership</span><h2 class="display-md balance">The team building it.</h2></div>
    <div style="max-width:760px;margin:44px auto 0">
      <p class="body-lg muted pretty" style="margin-bottom:18px">We're a small team of platform engineers, SREs, and designers who have run the platform teams we're now building for. We've felt the pain of rebuilding the same plumbing every two years — Ybor is the backend we wished we had.</p>
      <p class="body-lg muted pretty">We keep teams small, so the person who builds a thing is the one who runs it. We're hiring across engineering, design, and go-to-market — see the <a href="/careers" style="color:var(--purple-dark);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px">open roles</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- VALUES -->
<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head center"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="slash">//</span> values</span><h2 class="display-md balance">How we work.</h2></div>
    <div class="grid grid-3" style="margin-top:56px">
      <div class="card"><h3 class="heading-sm" style="margin-bottom:8px">Direct</h3><p class="body muted">We say the thing. No marketing varnish, no buried lede. If a sentence could run on any competitor's site, we rewrite it.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 class="heading-sm" style="margin-bottom:8px">Specific</h3><p class="body muted">Every claim hands you the receipt. We name the tools, the controls, and the trade-offs — because our buyers are engineers.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 class="heading-sm" style="margin-bottom:8px">Builder-to-builder</h3><p class="body muted">We sound like engineers talking to engineers. We've run the platform teams we're building for.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 class="heading-sm" style="margin-bottom:8px">Confident, not boastful</h3><p class="body muted">Calm and security-aware. We don't oversell — the architecture does the talking.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 class="heading-sm" style="margin-bottom:8px">Restrained</h3><p class="body muted">We ship less, better. One thousand no's for every yes, in the product and the platform.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3 class="heading-sm" style="margin-bottom:8px">Iterative</h3><p class="body muted">We release by release, not big-bang. The platform — and this company — gets better every commit.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- COMMUNITY -->
<section class="section bg-ink">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head center"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="slash">//</span> in the community</span><h2 class="display-md balance" style="color:#fff">Built on open source. Members of it.</h2></div>
    <div class="grid grid-3" style="margin-top:48px">
      <div class="card dark"><h3 class="heading-sm" style="color:#fff;margin-bottom:8px">Linux Foundation</h3><p class="body-sm muted-d" style="margin-bottom:14px">Member since 2024. We build on and contribute to the open-source platform ecosystem.</p><a class="link-arrow" href="https://www.linuxfoundation.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="font-size:13px">View listing <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></a></div>
      <div class="card dark"><h3 class="heading-sm" style="color:#fff;margin-bottom:8px">CNCF Silver Member</h3><p class="body-sm muted-d" style="margin-bottom:14px">Crossplane, Cluster API, Istio, Kyverno, ArgoCD — the platform is CNCF-native.</p><a class="link-arrow" href="https://www.cncf.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="font-size:13px">View listing <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></a></div>
      <div class="card dark"><h3 class="heading-sm" style="color:#fff;margin-bottom:8px">OpenSSF</h3><p class="body-sm muted-d" style="margin-bottom:14px">Our operators publish OpenSSF Scorecard results. Supply-chain security is a default, not a feature.</p><a class="link-arrow" href="https://github.com/ossf/scorecard" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="font-size:13px">View on GitHub <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right"></i></a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FINAL CTA -->
<section class="section bg-tint">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split split-6-6">
      <div class="card center" style="padding:40px"><h3 class="heading-lg" style="margin-bottom:12px">Want to work here?</h3><p class="body muted" style="margin-bottom:22px">We're hiring platform engineers, SREs, and designers who've felt the pain firsthand.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/careers">View open roles <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="ic"></i></a></div>
      <div class="card center" style="padding:40px"><h3 class="heading-lg" style="margin-bottom:12px">Want to partner?</h3><p class="body muted" style="margin-bottom:22px">System integrators, cloud partners, and tooling vendors — let's talk.</p><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/contact?intent=partner">Become a partner <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="ic"></i></a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Base>
